   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Superstar**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **(They Long to Be) Close to You**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **mmj2024-06-29** (recommended): audience recording; 15 songs; 94 min [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **mmj2024-06-29**: taped by opsopcopolis; transferred by opsopcopolis; source: AUD [1]. Also: Recorded with DPA 4060 microphones into a DPA d:Vice, captured on iOS using Apogee MetaRecorder; Post-processing chain: WAV files edited in ProTools, exported to WAV, then encoded with xACT to FLAC [1]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by Andrew DaRosa: [Hartford's Capitol Groove music festival announces daily schedules for this June](https://www.ctinsider.com/entertainment/article/capitol-groove-hartford-2025-schedule-khruangbin-20288460.php) [3]",
